Z||000003||rogergarrison||10-06-2001||06:02 PM||||My advise is to do any and all body mods before you paint it. The more layers of paint you add, the more problems youll have down the road. Not to mention mismatching colors. As a body shop owner, about the most you can put on is 2 paint jobs over the original. Any more and you need to strip it back down which is a real PITA.<P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=11878523&p=52990885"> ||||reg||1
